    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the executive law and the penal law, in relation to\nprohibiting certain convicted sex offenders from knowingly being within 1,000\nfeet of any place where pre-kindergarten or kindergarten instruction is\nprovided; and to amend the executive law, in relation to directing the\ncommissioner of corrections and community supervision to apply for quarterly\nlistings of all elementary and secondary schools in the state",
